  "automotive-body-and-related-repairers": { about: "Straightens, fills, and replaces damaged panels on vehicles. Prepares surfaces, applies paint, and restores the final finish.", day: ["Inspects the vehicle and plans the needed body repairs.","Removes the damaged parts and aligns the new body panels.","Fills, sands, and paints the panels to match the finish."] },
