  "electrical-power-line-installers-and-repairers": { about: "Installs and repairs the wires that carry electricity between locations. Climbs poles, works at heights, and restores power.", day: ["Reviews the outage list and gathers tools and materials.","Climbs the poles or uses lifts to work on the power lines.","Repairs or installs the lines and restores the service."] },
