  "ethical-hacker": { about: "Tests computer systems and networks for security weaknesses. Uses the same methods as attackers to find flaws and reports fixes to protect data.", day: ["Scans systems and reviews logs for suspicious activity.","Attempts controlled attacks to find weaknesses in defenses.","Documents findings and recommends patches and security changes."] },
